WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.435 --> 00:00:03.484
查看本次真实SDK Client / Inspect this actual SDK Client

2
00:00:03.484 --> 00:00:06.503
定位本次暂停Tool的MCP权限 / Locate MCP permission for this pause Tool

3
00:00:06.503 --> 00:00:09.516
发起一个尚待审批的操作 / Start an operation awaiting approval

4
00:00:09.516 --> 00:00:12.548
调用方真实取消该请求 / Have the caller actually cancel the request

5
00:00:12.548 --> 00:00:15.588
定位Diagnostics查询与导出权限 / Locate Diagnostics query and export permissions

6
00:00:15.588 --> 00:00:18.586
SDK实际查询Recent且不出现审批 / Query Recent through the SDK without approval

7
00:00:18.586 --> 00:00:21.583
用返回的traceId查询Trace / Query Trace using the returned traceId

8
00:00:21.583 --> 00:00:24.621
请求导出并检查实际参数 / Request export and review actual arguments

9
00:00:24.621 --> 00:00:27.656
Deny不打开文件窗口 / Deny without opening a file window

10
00:00:27.656 --> 00:00:40.864
再次请求导出 / Request export again

11
00:00:40.864 --> 00:00:44.187
Allow后仍有真正的Save窗口 / Allow still opens a real Save window

12
00:00:44.187 --> 00:00:48.765
真实取消原生Save / Actually cancel native Save

13
00:00:48.765 --> 00:01:00.872
重新请求需要保存的导出 / Request the export to save

14
00:01:00.872 --> 00:01:05.126
保存guide-mcp-diagnostics.jsonl / Save guide-mcp-diagnostics.jsonl

15
00:01:05.126 --> 00:01:08.087
查询真实任务并核对文件 / Query the actual task and verify the file

16
00:01:08.087 --> 00:01:11.313
清空搜索返回Client控制 / Clear search and return to Client controls

17
00:01:11.313 --> 00:01:14.350
本次长调用选择Auto / Select Auto for this long-call example

18
00:01:14.350 --> 00:01:17.425
发起真实未完成的Composer请求 / Start an actual unfinished Composer request

19
00:01:17.425 --> 00:01:20.504
在途调用期间打开撤销确认 / Open revocation confirmation during the call

20
00:01:20.504 --> 00:01:23.599
撤销Client并核对真实请求取消 / Revoke the Client and verify actual request cancellation

21
00:01:23.599 --> 00:01:26.575
旧Client身份不能再查询 / Verify the old Client identity cannot query again

22
00:01:26.575 --> 00:01:29.604
关闭本轮MCP Server / Disable this run’s MCP Server
